### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### FINANCE - INCOMES
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Criar receita
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/incomes
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: fc_access_token={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 250.00,
  "description": "Corrida Uber manhã",
  "date": "2026-03-29",
  "notes": "Pagamento em dinheiro"
}

###

### Atualizar receita
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/incomes/{{incomeId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 300.00,
  "description": "Corrida Uber ajustada",
  "date": "2026-03-29",
  "notes": "Valor corrigido"
}

###

### Excluir receita
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/incomes/{{incomeId}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### FINANCE - EXPENSES
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Criar despesa
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 75.50,
  "description": "Combustível",
  "date": "2026-03-29",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "notes": "Abastecimento do turno da manhã"
}

###

### Atualizar despesa
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 82.00,
  "description": "Combustível ajustado",
  "date": "2026-03-29",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "notes": "Valor atualizado após conferência"
}

###

### Excluir despesa
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

###

### ----------------------------------------------------------------------
### CENÁRIOS ÚTEIS DE APOIO
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------

### Criar receita sem autenticação
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/incomes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 120.00,
  "description": "Receita sem token",
  "date": "2026-03-29",
  "notes": "Deve retornar 401"
}

###

### Criar despesa com payload inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/expenses
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": -10,
  "description": "",
  "date": "2026-99-99",
  "categoryId": "categoria-invalida",
  "notes": "Deve retornar erro de validação"
}

###

### Atualizar receita com id inválido
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/incomes/id-invalido
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 300.00,
  "description": "Receita teste id inválido",
  "date": "2026-03-29",
  "notes": "Teste"
}

###

### Atualizar despesa com categoryId inválido
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/expenses/{{expenseId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{authCookieName}}={{authToken}}

{
  "amount": 50.00,
  "description": "Despesa com categoria inválida",
  "date": "2026-03-29",
  "categoryId": "categoria-invalida",
  "notes": "Deve falhar"
}

###

### Excluir despesa sem autenticação
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/finance/expenses/{{expenseId}}

###